ainer floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%85%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%85%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>铜奖章</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分15以上的文档</strong></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong><em>首篇：<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-254">SCP-CN-254</a></em></strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%80%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%80%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>银奖章</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分30以上的文档</strong></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong><em>首篇：<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1184">SCP-CN-1184</a></em></strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%87%91%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%87%91%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>金奖章</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分50以上的文档</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%BF%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89%E3%81%84%E3%83%BB%E3%81%9D%E3%81%86%E3%81%95%E3%81%8F.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%BF%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89%E3%81%84%E3%83%BB%