</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xanarchy-militia" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6910500&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609487835" alt="XANARCHY MILITIA" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6910500)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xanarchy-militia" >XANARCHY MILITIA</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-850772-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 除了O5议会成员，他们似乎确信SCP-0000-D的影响源自于大规模记忆删除程序，并将SCP-0000-D的影响归咎于经历了这种程序。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-850772-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. 虽然死亡警报系统在对十四个宇宙的死亡案例后行分析后被证明其是有效的，但目前扩大该系统的计划仍在管理员魏尔伦办公室内等待批准。</div> </div> 
