&lt;li&gt;陸蟹圖片來自&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/gallery&quot;&gt;畫廊&lt;/a&gt;，&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yu-ken-dai&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4351112&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609487837&quot; alt=&quot;Yu Ken Dai&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4351112)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yu-ken-dai&quot;  &gt;Yu Ken Dai&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;上傳的&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/gallery/IMAG0208.jpg&quot;&gt;圖片&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
